AB  - Seismic emergency handing system is the last key to earthquake early warning technology. NB-IoT communication technology has the advantages of low cost, low power consumption and wide coverage compared with traditional 4G and other wireless communication methods. In recent years, NB-IoT communication technology has been widely applied in the field of internet of things, but there is no report that it has been applied in the field of earthquake early warning. This paper introduces a new type of gas seismic emergency handing system based on NB-IoT, discusses the principle and basic composition of the device, analyzes its advantages over the existing devices, introduces the key points in the development process. This paper aims at promoting, the solution of gas seismic emergency handing system based on NB-IoT to provide technical guarantee for gas safety under earthquake. © 2021 Science Press. All rights reserved.
