TI  - An Evaluative Study on IoT Ecosystem for Smart Predictive Maintenance (IoT-SPM) in Manufacturing: Multiview Requirements and Data Quality
PY  - 2023
T2  - IEEE Internet of Things Journal
VL  - 10
IS  - 13
SP  - 11160
EP  - 11184
